$$
\Gamma(\tfrac16)\Gamma(\tfrac23)=2^{2/3}\sqrt\pi\,\Gamma(\tfrac13),\qquad
\Gamma(\tfrac13)\Gamma(\tfrac23)=\frac{2\pi}{\sqrt3}.
$$
Therefore
$$
\Gamma(\tfrac16)=2^{-1/3}\sqrt{\frac3\pi}\,\Gamma(\tfrac13)^2.
$$

